# LumaLoop mobile — environment template (ADO #129, M5). Copy to `.env`,
# `.env.development`, and `.env.production` (all gitignored per the repo's secrets
# policy) and set per environment. Expo inlines `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` vars at build time.
#
# Telemetry ingestion base URL. The RN telemetry client POSTs each event to
# `${EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL}/api/event` — the SAME deployed Vercel ingestion as
# the web app (→ Supabase `telemetry_events`). No trailing slash. If unset, the
# client falls back to the documented default in `src/telemetry/endpoint.ts`.
#
# NOTE (ADO #82): set the STABLE production URL here for `.env.production`, and
# remove Vercel Deployment Protection on `/api/event`, before a real device can
# deliver. The value is NOT a secret (no keys ship in the client).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://luma-loop.vercel.app
